        B.q("psm-p4-77", "psm-product-backlog", "A team sets a new Product Goal at every Sprint Planning. What is wrong with this?", listOf("Nothing is wrong; renewing the Product Goal at every Sprint Planning keeps the team responsive", "It confuses the goals: the Product Goal is the long-term objective, while each Sprint has a Sprint Goal", "The Product Goal should be set at the start of the product and stay the same for its whole life", "The Developers should set the Product Goal instead, since they know best what can actually be built"), setOf(1),
