        B.q("psm-p4-78", "psm-product-backlog", "A stakeholder says that once an item is in the Product Backlog, the team has promised to build it. What fits the Scrum Guide?", listOf("Right; once an item is added it has to be built eventually, though its order may change", "The Product Backlog is emergent, and the Product Owner may remove items that no longer add value", "Only the stakeholder who first asked for an item can agree to remove it from the Product Backlog", "Items cannot be removed before the end of a release, when the whole Product Backlog is formally reviewed"), setOf(1),
            "The Guide describes the Product Backlog as an emergent, ordered list of what is needed to improve the product. Its content changes as more is learned, and the Product Owner is accountable for it.",
