        B.q("psm-p4-79", "psm-product-backlog", "The Developers keep a separate list of technical improvements that the Product Owner never sees, and plan to work through it in a hardening Sprint. What fits the Scrum Guide?", listOf("The Product Backlog is the single source of work, so this work belongs there, visible and ordered", "That is fine, because technical work is part of how the work is done, which the Developers decide", "That is fine as long as the Scrum Master keeps the list and shares it at each Sprint Review", "Keep the list, and hold a hardening Sprint after each release so the team can work through it"), setOf(0),
            "The Product Backlog is an emergent, ordered list of what is needed to improve the product and the single source of work undertaken by the Scrum Team. Hidden lists break transparency.",
            whyWrong = mapOf(
