        B.q("psm-p4-80", "psm-sprint-backlog", "A team believes the Sprint Goal only matters at the Sprint Review; day to day, the Developers just work through their tasks. What does the Scrum Guide say?", listOf("Right; the Sprint Goal is checked at the Sprint Review, when the Sprint ends", "As the Developers work during the Sprint, they keep the Sprint Goal in mind", "The Sprint Goal is checked by the Product Owner, who tracks it for the team", "The Sprint Goal guides Sprint Planning; after that, the task list takes over"), setOf(1),
