        B.q("psm-p4-81", "psm-sprint-backlog", "A stakeholder believes the Sprint Goal is met only if every selected item is finished exactly as planned. What does the Scrum Guide say?", listOf("Right; the Sprint Goal is the set of selected items, each finished as originally planned", "The Sprint Goal provides flexibility in terms of the exact work needed to achieve it", "The Sprint Goal is met as long as at least half of the selected items are finished", "The Sprint Goal is optional, so the items themselves are what the team commits to"), setOf(1),
