        B.q("psm-p4-83", "psm-sprint-backlog", "This Sprint holds mostly unrelated bug fixes, so the Product Owner says a Sprint Goal is not needed this time. What fits the Scrum Guide?", listOf("Every Sprint has a Sprint Goal, which gives coherence and focus and keeps the team working together", "That is fine for maintenance Sprints, where the items cannot be tied to one shared objective", "That is fine as long as the Developers agree, since the Sprint Backlog is their own plan", "The list of bug fixes can serve as the Sprint Goal, since it states exactly what will be done"), setOf(0),
